Thai Waters Rev F | key_released
* K3-2 and SW1 to K3-1/GND; switch loop 10000000000.0 ohm.
* Model: Rev 2 R38=510 ohm, R37=1k, R65=100k. PMIC internal pull represented by an assumed 50k to 3.3 V; CMOS bounds are design targets.
Vdd v 0 3.3
Rinternal v pwron 50k
R38 pwron raw 510
R65 v g 100k
R37 g raw 1k
Rkey raw 0 10000000000.0
Cloom raw 0 100p
.TRAN 1u 10u
.PRINT TRAN V(pwron) V(raw)
.END
